er","description":"The world of technology is changing. It used to be one where users could post on social media, order clothes online, and play mobile games without a care in the world. As time progressed, companies eventually realized that they could collect small pieces of information from a user\u2019s technological habits, and use that to form a profile of the user of some sort. I used a packet-monitoring service to listen in on third-party applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":173670,"global_rank":418672},{"name":"addyg/NewsWebsiteCrawler","owner":"addyg","html_url":"https://github.com/addyg/NewsWebsiteCrawler","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Crawl news websites with Crawler4j","topics":[],"score":173670,"global_rank":418673},{"name":"chris3kuete/CrossStackReference--Devops","owner":"chris3kuete","html_url":"https://github.com/chris3kuete/CrossStackReference--Devops","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Reference Resources from another stack","topics":[],"score":173670,"global_rank":418674},{"name":"gaugup/TypescriptResources","owner":"gaugup","html_url":"https://github.com/gaugup/TypescriptResources","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Repository for useful material on Typescript programming language.","topics":[],"score":173670,"global_rank":418675},{"name":"DouglasUrner/SSC-Demo","owner":"DouglasUrner","html_url":"https://github.com/DouglasUrner/SSC-Demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":173667,"global_rank":418676},{"name":"ianmarmour/PathOfExileLogUploader","owner":"ianmarmour","html_url":"h